.10256410256410256, "x1": 0.17032967032967034, "y1": 0.11188811188811189}, {"text": "Attempt Question 1", "x0": 0.0945054945054945, "y0": 0.11888111888111888, "x1": 0.26043956043956046, "y1": 0.1320901320901321}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.0945054945054945, "y0": 0.13442113442113443, "x1": 0.42527472527472526, "y1": 0.14374514374514374}, {"text": "Answer the question in a SEPARATE writing booklet.", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.16705516705516704, "x1": 0.5208791208791209, "y1": 0.18026418026418026}, {"text": "Your answer will be a:", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.21522921522921523, "x1": 0.26373626373626374, "y1": 0.22455322455322455}, {"text": "ed on how well you:", "x0": 0.3021978021978022, "y0": 0.21522921522921523, "x1": 0.4582417582417582, "y1": 0.22843822843822845}, {"text": "\u00a9 demonstrate understanding of how ideas about language, identity and culture are", "x0": 0.12637362637362637, "y0": 0.2331002331002331, "x1": 0.7824175824175824, "y1": 0.2463092463092463}, {"text": "expressed through texts", "x0": 0.15604395604395604, "y0": 0.25097125097125095, "x1": 0.3395604395604396, "y1": 0.2641802641802642}, {"text": "demonstrate understanding of how language is used to shape meaning about", "x0": 0.15604395604395604, "y0": 0.26884226884226886, "x1": 0.7516483516483516, "y1": 0.28205128205128205}, {"text": "individuals and/or cultural groups", "x0": 0.15604395604395604, "y0": 0.2867132867132867, "x1": 0.4208791208791209, "y1": 0.3006993006993007}, {"text": "your id", "x0": 0.3978021978021978, "y0": 0.30536130536130535, "x1": 0.4472527472527473, "y1": 0.3146853146853147}, {"text": "organise, develop and expre:", "x0": 0.15604395604395604, "y0": 0.30536130536130535, "x1": 0.37252747252747254, "y1": 0.3185703185703186}, {"text": "s using language appropriate to audience,", "x0": 0.46483516483516485, "y0": 0.30536130536130535, "x1": 0.7791208791208791, "y1": 0.3185703185703186}, {"text": "purpose and form", "x0": 0.15604395604395604, "y0": 0.32323232323232326, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.33644133644133645}, {"text": "Question 1 - (20 marks)", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.3714063714063714, "x1": 0.2879120879120879, "y1": 0.3838383838383838}, {"text": "\u2018The greatest influence on an individual\u2019s identity is their cultural connections.", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.4063714063714064, "x1": 0.6967032967032967, "y1": 0.4195804195804196}, {"text": "\u2018To what extent do you agree with this statement?", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.4382284382284382, "x1": 0.47802197802197804, "y1": 0.45143745143745145}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.47086247086247085, "x1": 0.6054945054945055, "y1": 0.4840714840714841}, {"text": "The prescribed text is:", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.5353535353535354, "x1": 0.2846153846153846, "y1": 0.5485625485625486}, {"text": "\u00a9 Drama Shaw, George Bernard, Pygmalion", "x0": 0.12637362637362637, "y0": 0.5695415695415695, "x1": 0.4912087912087912, "y1": 0.5827505827505828}, {"text": "End of section I", "x0": 0.4318681318681319, "y0": 0.8904428904428905, "x1": 0.567032967032967, "y1": 0.8997668997668997}], [{"text": "Section II \u2014 Module B: Close Study of Literature", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.06993006993006994, "x1": 0.5043956043956044, "y1": 0.08236208236208237}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.08624708624708624, "x1": 0.17032967032967034, "y1": 0.09557109557109557}, {"text": "Attempt Question 2", "x0": 0.0945054945054945, "y0": 0.10256410256410256, "x1": 0.26263736263736265, "y1": 0.11577311577311578}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.0945054945054945, "y0": 0.11810411810411811, "x1": 0.42527472527472526, "y1": 0.12742812742812742}, {"text": "Answer the question in a SEPARATE writing booklet.", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.15073815073815075, "x1": 0.5208791208791209, "y1": 0.16394716394716394}, {"text": "Your answer will be -d on how well you:", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.1989121989121989, "x1": 0.4582417582417582, "y1": 0.21134421134421136}, {"text": "\u00a9 demonstrate understanding of a text\u2019s distinctive qualities and how these shape meaning", "x0": 0.12527472527472527, "y0": 0.20901320901320902, "x1": 0.8406593406593407, "y1": 0.2338772338772339}, {"text": "\u00a9 organise, develop and , purpose and form.", "x0": 0.12527472527472527, "y0": 0.23465423465423466, "x1": 0.8923076923076924, "y1": 0.24786324786324787}, {"text": "ideas using language appropriate to audienc:", "x0": 0.3923076923076923, "y0": 0.23465423465423466, "x1": 0.7296703296703296, "y1": 0.24786324786324787}, {"text": "Question 2 - Fiction - Haddon, Mark, The Curious Incident of the Dog in the Night-Time (20", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.2828282828282828, "x1": 0.8989010989010989, "y1": 0.29526029526029524}, {"text": "marks)", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.29914529914529914, "x1": 0.14725274725274726, "y1": 0.31157731157731156}, {"text": "Explain how Mark Haddon creates a unique narrative voice to examine the importance of connections.", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.331002331002331, "x1": 0.8978021978021978, "y1": 0.3442113442113442}, {"text": "In your response make detailed reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.3628593628593629, "x1": 0.6010989010989011, "y1": 0.37606837606837606}, {"text": "The prescribed text is:", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.42735042735042733, "x1": 0.2846153846153846, "y1": 0.4405594405594406}, {"text": "\u00a9 Fiction \u2014 Haddon, Mark, The Carious Incident of the Dog in the Night-Time", "x0": 0.12637362637362637, "y0": 0.46153846153846156, "x1": 0.7065934065934066, "y1": 0.47474747474747475}, {"text": "End of section IT", "x0": 0.42747252747252745, "y0": 0.878010878010878, "x1": 0.5714285714285714, "y1": 0.8873348873348873}], [{"text": "Section III - Module C: The Craft of Writing", "